# Plugins/*/Binaries/
# Plugins/*/Intermediate/

# ----- Packaging / Distribution ---------------------------------------------
Releases/
Packages/
*.pak
*.ucas
*.utoc
*.sig

# ----- Shader Cache ---------------------------------------------------------
ShaderCache/

# ----- Crash Reports --------------------------------------------------------
Saved/Crashes/
Saved/Logs/

# ----- OS Artefacts ---------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db

# ----- Miscellaneous --------------------------------------------------------
*.bak
*.tmp
*.temp
*~